            "event": "Extreme rain-flood warning",
            "expires": "2026-10-01T00:00:00+02:00",
            "headline": "Extreme rain-flood warning",
            "instruction": "I stay at home and keep myself informed of the authorities' instructions. I don't use my car. I don't pick up my children from school. I keep away from rivers, low points and bridges and reach the highest point possible. I take shelter upstairs, as a last resort on the roof, I don't go down to the basements. I evacuate only on the order of the authorities and take my emergency kit.",
